        "text": "26"
      },
      {
        "key": "D",
        "text": "13"
      },
      {
        "key": "E",
        "text": "5"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "A",
    "acceptedAnswers": null,
    "answerUnit": null,
    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Count factors of 2 and 5",
        "body": "$15^6=3^6\\cdot5^6$, $28^5=2^{10}\\cdot7^5$, $55^7=5^7\\cdot11^7$. The product has $2^{10}$ and $5^{13}$. Each trailing zero needs one $2$ and one $5$, so there are $\\min(10,13)=10$ zeros.\n\n**Answer: (A) 10**"
      }
    ],
